# Git workflow

Remote: `https://github.com/ybedoyab/hegemon` only. The repository is private; competitive code may be pushed. Re-check visibility before every push.

Commit on a feature branch. Do not force-push, rewrite history, or skip hooks. Do not commit `.env`, `kaggle.json`, datasets, or weights.

The user authorized commits and pushes for this project. Still do not submit to Kaggle.
